	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/opence_additions/help_strings">
		<string text="" />
		<string text="Aimed: the name of the player you aim at, as in\nHalo PC. Or always all, allies' or enemies'." />
		<string text="How large the players' names are drawn." />
		<string text="Your legs in first person, seen looking down,\nmoving as you run. Your body as others see it." />
		<string text="Grenade throws that keep your legs moving, and\nriders' hands off the grips to throw and reload." />
		<string text="The energy shield's flare on your first-person\narms too, as on your body." />
		<string text="Your shield's flare in an armor color, whatever\nyour armor. Only you see it. Default: its own." />
		<string text="Shields light their surroundings as they flare,\nin the shield's own color." />
		<string text="Light Show: the shield glow three times as far,\nat full from a third of the flare." />
		<string text="The field of view and the first-person\nweapon. Their defaults keep the stock view." />
	</strings>
